               gettext,
               make
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://linux-hardware.org/

Package: cockpit-hardware-probe
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         cockpit-bridge
Recommends: hw-probe
Description: Cockpit UI around hw-probe
 Cockpit plugin around hw-probe. It can run a local hardware probe, show a
 hardware summary and conservative findings, and optionally upload a probe
 to linux-hardware.org after explicit confirmation.
 .
 Running a local hardware probe does not upload data. Uploading to
 linux-hardware.org is a separate explicit action.
